rary-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontsize:17px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textalign:center;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontfamily:Quicksand;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-lineheight:125%;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-letterspacing:0px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-texttransform:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-521cfaca-8506-44e9-8ad2-5a5973ad7275-attributes-color:#b7d7d5"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: inherit">In 1977, a guideline outright banned most women of “childbearing potential” from medical research, ensuring that the next generations would be using painkillers tested almost entirely on men.*</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="565643f8-135e-45e4-92c0-6bc203e56afc" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1qr3tr0 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-color:#2A2A2A;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontsize:17px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textalign:center;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontfamily:Quicksand;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-lineheight:125%;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-letterspacing:0px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-texttransform:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit; text-transform: inherit; background-color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: var(--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textstroke);">Women experience nearly twice the rate of adverse drug reactions as men, yet we are still told to rely on outdated painkillers that only address </span><strong style="color: inherit; font-style: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit; text-transform: inherit; background-color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: var(--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textstroke);">one cause of period pain while ignoring two major triggers entirely.*</strong></p><p><br></p><p>No wonder the pain keeps coming back just as strong every month. Meanwhile, the hidden cost keeps rising. Taking just six painkillers per cycle adds up to<strong> 5,000 pills in a lifetime without ever addressing the root cause.*</strong></p><p><br></p><p>But for the first time, leading menstrual health specialists have developed a way to target all three period pain triggers at once.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b1cf9550-bae1-4936-957b-b2ac98df09ad" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="solution" tabindex="-1" id="solution" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1ygklx7"><div data-rid="002b6601-e122-4df1-b48f-7fa2f1ae209a" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-xhig4m"><div data-rid="a52d1a73-6bae-4834-b97a-d1263effce9e" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-16up4lt alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-4be702cb-ad0b-400f-9b45-e09d36e84cd6-attributes-color:#252a31;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-4be702cb-ad0b-400f-9b45-e09d36e84cd6-attributes-fontsize:44px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-4be702cb-ad0b-400f-9b45-e09d36e84cd6-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-4be702cb-ad0b-400f-9b45-e09d36e84cd6-attributes-fontfamily:Lora, serif;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-4be702cb-ad0b-400f-9b45-e09d36e84cd6-attributes-fontweight:600;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-4be702cb-ad0b-400f-9b45-e09d36e84cd6-attributes-lineheight:57.2px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-4be702cb-ad0b-400f-9b45-e09d36e84cd6-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-4be702cb-ad0b-400f-9b45-e09d36e84cd6-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-4be702cb-ad0b-400f-9b45-e09d36e84cd6-a